Package: cutefish-disk-utility
Architecture: any
Depends: cutefish-toolkit,
         btrfs-progs,
         dosfstools,
         e2fsprogs,
         exfatprogs,
         ntfs-3g,
         polkitd,
         udisks2,
         xfsprogs,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: CutefishOS Disk Utility
 Lists the disks, volumes and disk images, and mounts, erases, partitions,
 checks and repairs them. The disks come from UDisks2; each filesystem it
 formats needs the tools of its own package, all of which this one pulls in.
